{"Title":"An Act establishing a sick leave bank for Tiffany Brennan, an employee of the Trial Court of the Commonwealth","BillNumber":"S2672","DocketNumber":"SD2947","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2024-01-11T13:35:41.243"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2024-01-11T13:35:41.2433333"},{"Id":"JSC1","Name":"Josh S. Cutler","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JSC1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-11T14:39:00.0466667"},{"Id":"WCG1","Name":"William C. Galvin","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WCG1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-25T12:54:58.86"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2672/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Brady, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2672) (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Michael D. Brady, Josh S. Cutler and William C. Galvin for legislation to establish a sick leave bank for Tiffany Brennan, an employee of the Trial Court of the Commonwealth.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tNotwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the Massachusetts Trial Court shall establish a sick leave bank for Tiffany Brennan, an employee of the Trial Court. Any employee of the Massachusetts Trial Court may voluntarily contribute one or more sick, personal, or vacation days to the sick leave bank for use by Tiffany Brennan. If Tiffany Brennan terminates employment with the Trial Court or requests to dissolve the sick leave bank, any remaining time in the sick leave bank shall be transferred to the Trial Court-paid leave bank. Sick leave bank days shall not be used for absences unrelated to the illness or disability that necessitated the establishment of the sick leave bank as determined by the Massachusetts Trial Court.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"S2672","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2672/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"}]}